          "type": "text",
          "data": {
            "html": "<p>On the night of 14 November, Jupiter rises at sunset and crosses the southern meridian at midnight at an apparent diameter of 49.8 arcseconds. Even a modest 80mm refractor resolves the Great Red Spot transit and Io&#x27;s black shadow.</p>",
